x}&=\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\mathbf{x}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDivide every component by $3$. Substitution into the original equation verifies this vector."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713013 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "313ec808-0aac-5054-b832-323fe69be48d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713008} {:answer/id #uuid "75c4f1c3-daf0-5ef8-b4e0-fa419c0430fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713011} {:answer/id #uuid "c400254f-6600-5f3d-8c35-4a68dd3fa255" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713021} {:answer/id #uuid "d134360e-a0b4-5c59-9f57-6f48166c9155" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713022} {:answer/id #uuid "ff1894e6-70d7-5520-a9b2-d29ec5f5a9a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713025}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c400254f-6600-5f3d-8c35-4a68dd3fa255" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713021} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc40cb61-1afc-513a-850e-7a7aa184f55d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713019}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "82fbdc3f-09ce-5fd3-b185-2a07481516d0" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind $x_1+x_2$ for $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, or select **No solution** if no pair of coefficients satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x_1+2x_2 \\\\ 2x_1+x_2 \\\\ x_1-x_2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1+2x_2 &=1 \\\\ 2x_1+x_2 &=-1 \\\\ x_1-x_2 &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, $x_1=1-2x_2$. Substituting into the second gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(1-2x_2)+x_2&=-1 \\\\ 2-3x_2&=-1 \\\\ x_2&=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen $x_1=1-2(1)=-1$. These two equations force the only possible pair to be $(x_1,x_2)=(-1,1)$. However, the third component requires\n\n$$\nx_1-x_2=3,\\qquad (-1)-1=-2\\ne 3.\n$$\n\nThus this pair fails the vector equation, and no other pair can satisfy the first two component equations. There is **no solution**. The candidate sum $-1+1=0$ is not a valid answer because its coefficients do not satisfy all three components."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713016 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0559953c-0740-58b7-9f71-618ee50a6b62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713005} {:answer/id #uuid "0bbf72fb-aab0-5adc-a39e-3d179eab8b40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713006} {:answer/id #uuid "14f0259e-4da6-551d-9a75-fb8dc27d46db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713007} {:answer/id #uuid "84dc22d5-b424-5628-b109-5a866e654e2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713014} {:answer/id #uuid "b30ba222-13f0-5edb-be4a-9a54eff97fe7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713018}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0bbf72fb-aab0-5adc-a39e-3d179eab8b40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713006} :answer-field/id #uuid "eae91ac9-0fd2-5fe9-b2c4-6e48b6c8ebc4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713024}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "872280dc-4b76-592b-a7f6-2a21c9101a5b" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind $x_1+x_2$ for $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, or select **No solution** if no pair of coefficients satisfies the vector equation.\n\nEquating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1+2x_2 &=-1 \\\\ x_2 &=-2 \\\\ 2x_1+x_2 &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the second equation to find $x_2$, substitute into the first to find $x_1$, and check the third equation before choosing the sum." :question/worked-solution "The vector equation equates all three components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x_1+2x_2 \\\\ x_2 \\\\ 2x_1+x_2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThus we must solve\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1+2x_2 &=-1 \\\\ x_2 &=-2 \\\\ 2x_1+x_2 &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe second equation gives $x_2=-2$. Substituting into the first gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1+2(-2)&=-1 \\\\ x_1&=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe third equation also holds, since $2(3)+(-2)=4$. Hence\n\n$$\n3\\mathbf{a}_1-2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nTherefore $x_1+x_2=3+(-2)=1$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713017 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "387d07c1-2726-56e8-9af4-8dca827a0c02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713009} {:answer/id #uuid "8207921e-5cb7-5ae8-bb65-0466d873df1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713012} {:answer/id #uuid "86eb83ab-87f6-5d4d-82e2-8e85d2b50a74" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713015} {:answer/id #uuid "bf1dce54-f9ff-50c4-9080-81928c91af3f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713020} {:answer/id #uuid "e4668ccd-171b-5604-a85d-70783561a044" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713023}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8207921e-5cb7-5ae8-bb65-0466d873df1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713012} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f803bc6-02a4-5d6b-a93f-058aa2860ae4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713010}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "ab60e113-2728-55cf-973d-f1bcf9c55f20" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -11\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind $x_1+x_2$ for $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, or select **No solution** if no pair of coefficients satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x_1+2x_2 \\\\ 3x_1+x_2 \\\\ -x_1+3x_2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -11\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1+2x_2 &=-4 \\\\ 3x_1+x_2 &=3 \\\\ -x_1+3x_2 &=-11\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, $x_1=-4-2x_2$. Substitute this into the second:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(-4-2x_2)+x_2&=3 \\\\ -12-5x_2&=3 \\\\ -5x_2&=15 \\\\ x_2&=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen $x_1=-4-2(-3)=2$. Check the remaining component:\n\n$$\n-(2)+3(-3)=-2-9=-11.\n$$\n\nAll three component equations hold, so\n\n$$\n2\\mathbf{a}_1-3\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}.\n$$\n\nTherefore $x_1+x_2=2+(-3)=-1$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713085 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "126fa37f-f3ba-554b-bcd7-f302dbb1d274" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713086} {:answer/id #uuid "1408ce1a-f8df-5b01-96df-751d4a8be57f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713087} {:answer/id #uuid "85a47131-b57a-5840-a379-bc9c8fcb937b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713094} {:answer/id #uuid "b19a9a37-09be-57f9-ab94-af7e1c95f7ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713096} {:answer/id #uuid "dfcc9d9c-0433-5a05-a925-e697da3c73ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713101}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85a47131-b57a-5840-a379-bc9c8fcb937b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713094} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f456a33-11c6-5a00-96fa-3c13e55b96d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713089}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "1222c30a-fe2e-53b8-b113-8a05f9a87d4c" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2+x_3\\mathbf{a}_3=\\mathbf{b}$, then what is $x_1+x_2+x_3$?" :question/worked-solution "Expanding the scalar multiples and adding corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_2 \\\\ x_2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ x_3 \\\\ x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1+x_2 \\\\ x_2+x_3 \\\\ x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1+x_2 &=0 \\\\ x_2+x_3 &=3 \\\\ x_3 &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThis matrix is already in row echelon form. Read the last equation first and substitute upward:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_3&=2 \\\\ x_2+2&=3 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=1 \\\\ x_1+1&=0 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\mathbf{a}_1+\\mathbf{a}_2+2\\mathbf{a}_3&=\\mathbf{b}, \\\\ x_1+x_2+x_3&=-1+1+2=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713092 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19b9ef9b-9012-580d-91b1-4ab59815a8dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713088} {:answer/id #uuid "8e4eff19-ec85-597d-9087-0f7efa89ae1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713095} {:answer/id #uuid "c01c83b9-3c11-5337-bf58-70cac93e616b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713098} {:answer/id #uuid "d62f842b-e7ac-555f-8565-6243579f6850" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713100} {:answer/id #uuid "e8833afa-2d6c-5928-8477-b1a69bed93c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713103}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e4eff19-ec85-597d-9087-0f7efa89ae1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713095} :answer-field/id #uuid "84f592ae-c982-5053-ab39-2214cff7e5c6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713093}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "7096ca78-7b70-5b3d-aed8-8000c04b7f29" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2+x_3\\mathbf{a}_3=\\mathbf{b}$, then what is $x_1+x_2+x_3$?" :question/worked-solution "Expanding the scalar multiples and adding corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1 \\\\ 3x_1 \\\\ -2x_1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3x_2 \\\\ -8x_2 \\\\ 6x_2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2x_3 \\\\ 5x_3 \\\\ -3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1-3x_2+2x_3 \\\\ 3x_1-8x_2+5x_3 \\\\ -2x_1+6x_2-3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-3x_2+2x_3 &=3 \\\\ 3x_1-8x_2+5x_3 &=7 \\\\ -2x_1+6x_2-3x_3 &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & -5\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & -5\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -3 & -5\\end{array}\\right] && R_2:=R_2-3R_1 \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_3:=R_3+2R_1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe resulting system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-3x_2+2x_3 &=3 \\\\ x_2-x_3 &=-2 \\\\ x_3 &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nBack-substitute to find all three coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_3&=1 \\\\ x_2-1&=-2 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-1 \\\\ x_1-3(-1)+2(1)&=3 &&\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\mathbf{a}_1-\\mathbf{a}_2+\\mathbf{a}_3&=\\mathbf{b}, \\\\ x_1+x_2+x_3&=-2-1+1=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713102 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "048ba1aa-3cd1-568e-8a7c-e3e9409afe68" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713083} {:answer/id #uuid "07d66d55-55ad-55fa-93a2-7b785311d59a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713084} {:answer/id #uuid "5b9f9430-f0d0-582a-85ee-a121d459ba7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713090} {:answer/id #uuid "5d6cd4f0-d853-536e-bd7f-bda6ebc7ffd0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713091} {:answer/id #uuid "b5181919-4315-5939-b1af-64c7ac7e3f28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713097}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d6cd4f0-d853-536e-bd7f-bda6ebc7ffd0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713091} :answer-field/id #uuid "d35a3f4d-069c-5ce3-b674-872cb78591f5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713099}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "e4be4d61-f1d4-50f1-9dea-4bb25fe73dc5" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2+x_3\\mathbf{a}_3=\\mathbf{b}$, then what is $x_1+x_2+x_3$?" :question/worked-solution "Expanding the scalar multiples and adding corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1 \\\\ -x_1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2x_2 \\\\ 3x_2 \\\\ -x_2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2x_3 \\\\ x_3 \\\\ -3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_1-2x_2+2x_3 \\\\ -x_1+3x_2+x_3 \\\\ -x_2-3x_3\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-2x_2+2x_3 &=2 \\\\ -x_1+3x_2+x_3 &=-1 \\\\ -x_2-3x_3 &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] && R_2:=R_2+R_1 \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_3:=R_3+R_2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe resulting system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_1-2x_2+2x_3 &=2 \\\\ x_2+3x_3 &=1 \\\\ 0 &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe last equation, $0=3$, is false. No triple of coefficients satisfies all three component equations, so the vector equation has **no solution**. There is no value of $x_1+x_2+x_3$ to report."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713196 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31d567d1-6878-5185-9113-9823a320187c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713201} {:answer/id #uuid "57602155-f1bc-5cd3-9f35-07ed39fdf2e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713206} {:answer/id #uuid "96d5b01c-4e91-59ba-b354-88dd1175012e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713215} {:answer/id #uuid "d07c619a-4b76-5993-b056-12f959d0ba46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713221} {:answer/id #uuid "f5ade54b-6ced-5858-a4c6-159c53155889" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713229}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d07c619a-4b76-5993-b056-12f959d0ba46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713221} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc91254c-952c-5a64-9b28-27c0e8b11b8b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713219}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "038ab260-926c-564c-b137-6508c63ee7cf" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe third equation gives ${x}_{2}=-3$. Substituting into the first equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-(-3) &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(-4)-(-3) &\\ne-6 \\\\ -5 &\\ne-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe candidate fails this component, so no pair satisfies the vector equation. Select **No solution**."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713205 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6507d5a9-ac17-5517-ba09-a66ae3ff103f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713207} {:answer/id #uuid "80dd8535-3d8e-5466-80ec-5043e859073e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713210} {:answer/id #uuid "8631ef7f-f925-5a3c-b1c0-249566a6b722" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713212} {:answer/id #uuid "d9b5599e-cc01-569b-acc1-268209437822" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713223} {:answer/id #uuid "fda0129f-048d-5721-8f53-42fcd9b4a2c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713230}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d9b5599e-cc01-569b-acc1-268209437822" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713223} :answer-field/id #uuid "a39bd4aa-54ae-5b90-83c8-a5c3ef4c152d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713216}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "512c89c8-5e9b-5c90-a542-ed046f7f5cff" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=-5 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe third equation gives ${x}_{2}=4$. Substituting into the first equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2(4) &=-5 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3)-(4) &\\ne-3 \\\\ -1 &\\ne-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe candidate fails this component, so no pair satisfies the vector equation. Select **No solution**."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713208 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2980f5c5-c695-51d2-91e5-db7757a7bdf9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713199} {:answer/id #uuid "84246122-54c8-5b09-b907-9d2c76fd0f26" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713211} {:answer/id #uuid "c6b6e3eb-2f8b-5f5a-8a4e-0881d4614207" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713220} {:answer/id #uuid "dc36cabe-8c47-5418-8d39-748ca9af7726" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713224} {:answer/id #uuid "f430481c-e6e4-550b-913a-fda9d490789c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713228}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2980f5c5-c695-51d2-91e5-db7757a7bdf9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713199} :answer-field/id #uuid "49988664-f71b-5c29-aab6-b3bc1658c430" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713204}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "7bed2ddc-c568-5407-a6da-84a7334e4207" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{c}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{c}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{d}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{c}_1+x_2\\mathbf{c}_2=\\mathbf{d}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe second equation gives ${x}_{2}=2$. Substituting into the first equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2(2) &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the third equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(1)-2(2) &\\ne0 \\\\ -2 &\\ne0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe candidate fails this component, so no pair satisfies the vector equation. Select **No solution**."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713213 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "23c4ae82-691e-5a0b-a3e4-e64ece403916" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713198} {:answer/id #uuid "35433689-938b-5657-873f-16ea8fa4a084" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713202} {:answer/id #uuid "42fa92c7-e476-5915-98f6-a07a9fded0c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713203} {:answer/id #uuid "a7c712be-83d4-549c-ba26-242a14f117e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713217} {:answer/id #uuid "df795cbf-f0b2-5f7d-b679-4ee7a2cb5d96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713225}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "42fa92c7-e476-5915-98f6-a07a9fded0c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713203} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f83a508-4309-5117-aec0-f5355545de3d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713200}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "90b7df16-98a7-5144-937d-78923417839b" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -11\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -11\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=4 \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=-11\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe second equation gives ${x}_{2}=4$. Substituting into the third equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2(4) &=-11 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2(-3)-(4) &=2 \\\\ 2 &=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll three components agree. Therefore $x_1+x_2=(-3)+(4)=1$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713214 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0dcf6a51-41aa-5da7-952c-5f2d7ac38081" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713197} {:answer/id #uuid "7de68737-d93a-5e17-8c90-8e97824264e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713209} {:answer/id #uuid "a8d8ee34-bdd7-5bbd-bffb-bcf7a307ba19" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713218} {:answer/id #uuid "edecc5f5-ff9b-53c3-932b-dd3309e8522e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713226} {:answer/id #uuid "f2851372-bb50-5469-9fa3-59d7069e974d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713227}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f2851372-bb50-5469-9fa3-59d7069e974d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713227} :answer-field/id #uuid "d0efa522-883d-5279-b096-9af746ae25c1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713222}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "95ebc6c2-3cbf-50f6-b183-1c5d9cc3e95b" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{c}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{c}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{d}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{c}_1+x_2\\mathbf{c}_2=\\mathbf{d}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=5 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe first equation gives ${x}_{2}=2$. Substituting into the second equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+(2) &=5 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the third equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3)-(2) &=1 \\\\ 1 &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll three components agree. Therefore $x_1+x_2=(3)+(2)=5$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713242 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "122146c1-8e29-58bd-9d04-7c816b9495f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713233} {:answer/id #uuid "3742352d-9d69-50dc-986a-d45f4a9e6f1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713238} {:answer/id #uuid "3a5b3331-9d7f-5226-b5a1-c0b697b1f600" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713239} {:answer/id #uuid "9ce0506a-bf87-5e04-9b82-63f0983a69ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713248} {:answer/id #uuid "c717f4b4-bd51-580c-8b3f-92ce776f7698" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713253}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9ce0506a-bf87-5e04-9b82-63f0983a69ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713248} :answer-field/id #uuid "9ea5796a-b7ba-5129-987d-d07afac9d576" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713249}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "5c599097-e5cf-5bba-9e8d-82dd8f7084d2" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{c}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{c}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{d}=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -9 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{c}_1+x_2\\mathbf{c}_2=\\mathbf{d}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -9 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-7 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=-6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiply the third equation by $4$ and the first equation by $-3$, then add to eliminate $x_1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute into the third equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2(-3) &=-6 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} &=-12 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(-4)-3(-3) &\\ne-9 \\\\ -7 &\\ne-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe candidate fails this component, so no pair satisfies the vector equation. Select **No solution**."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713247 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "131d3b6d-5039-5bcd-9913-283129cfe6d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713234} {:answer/id #uuid "24161012-bd3e-5a54-abdb-5a953e68441b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713236} {:answer/id #uuid "2c6748a3-41af-5591-af37-de9eff5152b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713237} {:answer/id #uuid "5fb13aa2-2f1b-5c8c-844b-4728f0bdd881" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "28" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713244} {:answer/id #uuid "d4a59ef5-41da-5713-8493-8353cd6e868f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713255}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "131d3b6d-5039-5bcd-9913-283129cfe6d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713234} :answer-field/id #uuid "441a77c8-2c77-51ef-b1c4-43708721ce1f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713240}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "949f9ba2-e4ff-551c-bc04-dce38ba802b3" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ -15 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ -15 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=13 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=-15 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=9\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiply the second equation by $4$ and the first equation by $3$, then add to eliminate $x_1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7{x}_{2} &=-21 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute into the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+4(-3) &=-15 \\\\ -3{x}_{1} &=-3 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the third equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(1)-2(-3) &=9 \\\\ 9 &=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll three components agree. Therefore $x_1+x_2=(1)+(-3)=-2$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713251 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2333852f-8ade-54d4-b0ed-fca010a31815" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713235} {:answer/id #uuid "5dbf9a68-4bc4-5e6e-a25d-f4a0759e5bc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713243} {:answer/id #uuid "82d0379c-6ca3-5314-8ecc-056df3a808d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713245} {:answer/id #uuid "dc548029-a5c9-5c4d-8563-c464e762bf8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713256} {:answer/id #uuid "f82b9a12-37d5-5b48-8198-8d2b0009335f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713259}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "82d0379c-6ca3-5314-8ecc-056df3a808d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713245} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc06dfb1-5420-5f48-8126-b7c360a630d1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713254}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "aa152f23-971d-5089-bc05-3aefff06fb70" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiply the first equation by $2$ and the third equation by $-3$, then add to eliminate $x_1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute into the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+4(-1) &=2 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} &=6 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(2)-3(-1) &\\ne6 \\\\ 7 &\\ne6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe candidate fails this component, so no pair satisfies the vector equation. Select **No solution**."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713258 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f157221-98ac-5615-8cb5-3b936851d6e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713232} {:answer/id #uuid "4d85bcd0-ac37-5070-beaf-6dc29ae4b525" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713241} {:answer/id #uuid "86e84a20-8003-5f3c-8e14-ab14b6fc4fdc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713246} {:answer/id #uuid "c3671b43-ba7f-54c7-95fb-f83df136340c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713252} {:answer/id #uuid "de67ac18-d490-5935-a0fb-a3b97507e4cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713257}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d85bcd0-ac37-5070-beaf-6dc29ae4b525" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713241} :answer-field/id #uuid "a567d657-3ada-5ca4-994e-d6230901a39d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713250}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "f6ca286c-0c6e-5aff-942e-52ba029af726" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_1=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{a}_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf $x_1\\mathbf{a}_1+x_2\\mathbf{a}_2=\\mathbf{b}$, what is $x_1+x_2$? Select **No solution** if no pair satisfies the vector equation." :question/worked-solution "Expanding the vector equation and equating corresponding components gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 17\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-6 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=17\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiply the first equation by $3$ and the second equation by $-2$, then add to eliminate $x_1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{2} &=-20 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute into the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-3(4) &=-6 \\\\ 2{x}_{1} &=6 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThese two equations force this candidate pair. Check the third equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(3)+2(4) &=17 \\\\ 17 &=17\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll three components agree. Therefore $x_1+x_2=(3)+(4)=7$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713264 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03fed37d-c5f8-5416-807e-e515b51edf5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\quad x\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713260} {:answer/id #uuid "4505a3f2-dfb7-5cba-9270-d0aa0fd84b94" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713268} {:answer/id #uuid "4aab8acd-b098-5c17-beb7-e16c608a7076" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\quad x\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713270} {:answer/id #uuid "7d1c1b48-b8be-55ec-a8c3-f3d0e514ac1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713275} {:answer/id #uuid "8ea55517-9a9e-5114-b313-b94eb1d2730a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\quad x\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713276}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4aab8acd-b098-5c17-beb7-e16c608a7076" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\quad x\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713270} :answer-field/id #uuid "2a5a6068-4a0e-5cde-ac42-57615883bb1f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713265}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "25b5a0fc-8e48-5c54-894f-3e4bc65d8d82" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}0 & -\\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 & 2 & -\\frac{2}{3}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "The first coefficient column is zero, so the first pivot must be in the $y$-column. Normalize that pivot using $R_1\\leftarrow-\\frac{2}{3}R_1$:\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}0 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0 & 2 & -\\frac{2}{3}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThen use $R_2\\leftarrow R_2-2R_1$. The last entry becomes $-\\frac{2}{3}-2\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=0$, giving\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}0 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThis is row echelon form: the nonzero row is above the zero row, and its leading entry is in the second column. The corresponding system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y &=-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0x+0y &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe zero row imposes no restriction. Here $y$ is the basic variable, and $x$ is free because there is no pivot in the $x$-column. Therefore the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=x \\\\ y &=-\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $x$ is any real number. In vector form,\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ -\\frac{1}{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\quad x\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)\n$$\n\nIn the original rows, $-\\frac{3}{2}\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $2\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=-\\frac{2}{3}$, regardless of $x$. Fixing $x=0$ would give just one particular solution."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713273 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14e0f134-5097-5581-b72d-14bb4053a4f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713262} {:answer/id #uuid "2aaa131b-e396-5ac3-b35d-9e0598797bc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713266} {:answer/id #uuid "494d8700-5cfd-5f23-bc29-1c8ce6fae33d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2-4y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713269} {:answer/id #uuid "6dc8e293-cf40-56fc-9fd5-083b57a5a666" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713272} {:answer/id #uuid "7aab75a1-b7aa-5cd4-926d-5e9fbdc3f0b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713274}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7aab75a1-b7aa-5cd4-926d-5e9fbdc3f0b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713274} :answer-field/id #uuid "feaf4329-538b-539b-92df-155c2b0550e8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713280}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "72f9ab79-7c0f-5f7b-bf69-b5a06ef1c79b" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "The matrix is already in row echelon form. Its corresponding system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-4 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe second equation is true for every pair $x,y$, so it adds no restriction. The remaining equation is $x+2y=-4$. The pivot is in the $x$-column, so $x$ is basic and $y$ is free. Solving for $x$ gives $x=-4-2y$. Thus the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-4-2y \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is any real number. In vector form,\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)\n$$\n\nFor example, $y=0$ gives $(-4,0)$, but that is only one solution, not the full solution set."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713279 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0deb2e98-d707-5d9d-8e57-b6ec54541c75" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713261} {:answer/id #uuid "32f28b12-492e-5d43-834c-dea612dfe950" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713267} {:answer/id #uuid "6bf4ce43-4232-504e-9482-94f247e75d1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713271} {:answer/id #uuid "a3e8b78f-c87f-5665-9e81-7a1a4ec4787b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713277} {:answer/id #uuid "a9675ab4-2c66-5b90-9d67-b1ac8c02bce7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713278}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a3e8b78f-c87f-5665-9e81-7a1a4ec4787b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713277} :answer-field/id #uuid "22ba7921-4ed2-5c86-b2ff-475c230ca770" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713263}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "bfc67b4e-f4ff-5ebc-849a-c6469cffb637" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -3 & 6 & -9\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "First scale the entire first row, including its constant, using $R_1\\leftarrow\\frac{1}{2}R_1$:\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 6 & -9\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nNext use $R_2\\leftarrow R_2+3R_1$:\n\n$$\nM\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=3 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe second equation is an identity, not a requirement that $y=0$. The pivot is in the $x$-column. Thus $x$ is basic, $y$ is free, and $x=3+2y$. The general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=3+2y \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is any real number. In vector form,\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3+2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\quad y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the original equations gives $2(3+2y)-4y=6$ and $-3(3+2y)+6y=-9$, for every real $y$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713354 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3127f85c-d478-5e14-8fbd-e9cbd08f079a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713342} {:answer/id #uuid "37f07b7d-f4e6-5b70-bcf8-dda1ea28a396" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713343} {:answer/id #uuid "9f3c057e-cedf-58c8-a4b3-b67e49860874" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713360} {:answer/id #uuid "d2190eac-df31-5849-9974-62941803688a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713365} {:answer/id #uuid "df4fa0dd-3a5a-54ad-9e4b-fd09c839669f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9f3c057e-cedf-58c8-a4b3-b67e49860874" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713360} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f5576ed-6940-52b5-8bc0-6f2787c49489" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713346}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "6e428022-0377-5e4f-9de9-84176c2013bc" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} - x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{3} \\\\ x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} &=2 \\\\ x_{2} + x_{3} &=0 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} + x_{3} &=0 \\\\ x_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=0.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(1)(0)=0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=0\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(1)(0)+(1)(0)=-2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-2\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-2$, $x_2=0$, $x_3=0$, which means\n\n$$\n-2a_1+(0)a_2+(0)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} - x_{3}=(-2)+(0)+(0)=-2.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713355 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29a20b6c-5eda-51e8-8d4c-c22b9bdf1661" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713340} {:answer/id #uuid "2d0de62f-fe9d-50ff-86e4-2ade17186af9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713341} {:answer/id #uuid "47e275d5-c84d-5d49-b443-0ecd2b460b4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713347} {:answer/id #uuid "617cd8c5-7c73-58f9-85d9-6bbe2011585f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713353} {:answer/id #uuid "918b2080-5eec-53d8-88d2-9503aebb9039" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713359}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "47e275d5-c84d-5d49-b443-0ecd2b460b4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713347} :answer-field/id #uuid "ec199e82-f184-59c5-a101-a0b2150e2e71" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713367}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "72fc6cad-113f-5b05-87eb-11767ab04775" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} \\\\ x_{2} \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} &=-5 \\\\ x_{2} &=3 \\\\ - x_{3} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} &=5 \\\\ x_{2} &=3 \\\\ x_{3} &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=3.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(3)=3\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=3\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(1)(3)+(1)(3)=5\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-1\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-1$, $x_2=3$, $x_3=3$, which means\n\n$$\n-1a_1+(3)a_2+(3)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}=(-1)+(-3)+(3)=-1.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713357 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "030f73de-8493-509c-b7fa-c7b567614ed6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713338} {:answer/id #uuid "39ca9862-bc45-52da-8c3b-7e81a827ef53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713344} {:answer/id #uuid "f0d1c435-8869-5658-8484-f9c3588630af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713368} {:answer/id #uuid "f7c0c288-ec96-5cf9-bf65-2fe916e18fab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713370} {:answer/id #uuid "fba53540-aeca-5060-8c60-33f22e478f74" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713371}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39ca9862-bc45-52da-8c3b-7e81a827ef53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713344} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ff83aa9-f5ff-586e-8a26-8f6e8e3ac17e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713358}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "896a9ee8-8ddf-5421-a650-4d66a0b0717f" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ x_{1} \\\\ - x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{3} \\\\ - x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ x_{1} - x_{3} \\\\ - x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} &=-4 \\\\ x_{1} - x_{3} &=4 \\\\ - x_{1} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=R_{2}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} - x_{2} - x_{3} &=4 \\\\ x_{2} &=0 \\\\ x_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=-1.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(-1)=0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=0\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(-1)(0)+(-1)(-1)=4\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=3\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=3$, $x_2=0$, $x_3=-1$, which means\n\n$$\n3a_1+(0)a_2+(-1)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(-3)+(0)+(-1)=-4.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713362 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4be30bef-364e-55a4-a672-56419ee86b6c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713348} {:answer/id #uuid "537288f8-af67-579e-afcb-f8d0826ef139" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713351} {:answer/id #uuid "8859e3c8-cddd-55c8-9dfb-7ef4bad9122c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713356} {:answer/id #uuid "d1376bda-2e03-5a88-9764-916585d8572f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713364} {:answer/id #uuid "fe216153-745c-5783-8bcc-4e20f87018d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713372}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "537288f8-af67-579e-afcb-f8d0826ef139" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713351} :answer-field/id #uuid "54e1f414-1725-5d59-b505-6845ca5d6c7b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713352}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "a6853292-5214-56ba-853e-227a7f78ca5e" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ - x_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} + x_{3} \\\\ - x_{1} \\\\ - x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{2} + x_{3} &=1 \\\\ - x_{1} &=2 \\\\ - x_{3} &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=(-1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} &=-2 \\\\ x_{2} - x_{3} &=-1 \\\\ x_{3} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=2.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-1)(2)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=1\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(0)(1)+(0)(2)=-2\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=-2\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=-2$, $x_2=1$, $x_3=2$, which means\n\n$$\n-2a_1+(1)a_2+(2)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n- x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(2)+(1)+(2)=5.\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713369 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2746ebf3-5208-51f5-9c33-8cec4486cb39" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713339} {:answer/id #uuid "3c8ba999-fc5f-592f-8740-fc216452823f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713345} {:answer/id #uuid "4f068de0-b5ea-5167-97c5-98603254c7ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713349} {:answer/id #uuid "a0c946ed-7f59-5fd7-8acb-713d0326ebfb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713361} {:answer/id #uuid "cabd0bf3-54eb-5d5a-9171-cb02d3b76dcb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a0c946ed-7f59-5fd7-8acb-713d0326ebfb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713361} :answer-field/id #uuid "4fa9bc8d-8284-5f4c-864d-8cb0a190403e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713350}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "f7814008-3b02-55fd-8649-287703d8d72a" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}- x_{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ - x_{3} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}- x_{1} - x_{2} \\\\ - x_{3} \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- x_{1} - x_{2} &=1 \\\\ - x_{3} &=3 \\\\ x_{1} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right] && R_{1}:=(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}:=(-1)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=(-1)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{2} &=-1 \\\\ x_{3} &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=-3.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(0)(-3)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=-1\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n1x_1+(1)(-1)+(0)(-3)=-1\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=0\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=0$, $x_2=-1$, $x_3=-3$, which means\n\n$$\n0a_1+(-1)a_2+(-3)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} - x_{2} + x_{3}=(0)+(1)+(-3)=-2.\n$$\n\n"}]}
